{"kind":"sentence","lang":"zh-hans","entities":{"3357738":{"renderings":[{"id":"b623cd30776499a0","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"460629"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"小心踫头。","derivedFrom":{"value":"小心踫頭。","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"toJapanese"}]},"7558355":{"renderings":[{"id":"10c13d424ce4f340","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"8800830"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"汤姆，小心！","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"10806994":{"renderings":[{"id":"a8c3ebdaba29c6f8","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13949337"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"「妈，冰箱裡的『酱油渍菇』看起来很好吃欸。可以吃吗？」「吃是可以，但吃了好像会肚子痛，要小心喔。」「啊？谁做的啊？」「啊，那个是阿公去山上采的野菇，阿嬷拿去醃的啦。」「那裡面该不会混进了不能吃的毒菇吧？」「是这样吗？」","derivedFrom":{"value":"「媽，冰箱裡的『醬油漬菇』看起來很好吃欸。可以吃嗎？」「吃是可以，但吃了好像會肚子痛，要小心喔。」「啊？誰做的啊？」「啊，那個是阿公去山上採的野菇，阿嬤拿去醃的啦。」「那裡面該不會混進了不能吃的毒菇吧？」「是這樣嗎？」","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}